{{> head}}
{{> nav}}
<main id="main">
  <section class="section scheme-light" aria-labelledby="apply-title">
    <div class="container narrow apply">
      <header class="section-title apply__head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal><a class="text-link" href="/careers/">Careers</a> · Apply</p>
        <h1 class="h2" id="apply-title" data-split>Apply to Libre Studio</h1>
        <p class="text-lg" data-reveal>Share your work and a few short answers. Write them yourself: we read for how you think, not for polish.</p>
      </header>

      <article class="role" aria-labelledby="role-title" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Open role</p>
        <h2 class="h3" id="role-title">Senior Product Designer (Freelance, Remote)</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <h3 class="h5">Who we are</h3>
          <p>Libre Studio is a remote product design studio for startups and B2B SaaS teams, founded by Başak Feyzioğlu and based in Istanbul (GMT+3). We use AI tools every day, with a designer making every call. We are building a small group of senior freelance designers we can bring into client projects when the fit is right.</p>

          <h3 class="h5">What you'll work on</h3>
          <p>Client projects for startups and B2B SaaS teams: end-to-end flows, UI in an existing or new design system, UX research and audits, mobile and web apps, websites and conversion work. Each project comes with a written brief, a scope and acceptance criteria per milestone.</p>

          <h3 class="h5">How we work</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>High agency. You own your work, flag problems early and move things forward without being chased. We don't micromanage.</li>
            <li>Written first and async, in English, with occasional Turkish.</li>
            <li>At least 3 hours of overlap with Istanbul time (GMT+3) on working days.</li>
            <li>Figma for design, ClickUp for tasks, Slack for talk, written specs as the shared reference.</li>
            <li>You use AI tools daily, check what they give you and say where you used them. Design decisions stay human. <a class="text-link" href="/ai-design/">How we work with AI</a>.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="h5">Must have</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Senior-level product design experience. We are starting with seniors.</li>
            <li>A portfolio with shipped, live work where your own part is clear: what you did, what the team did.</li>
            <li>Clear written English. This is a must. Spoken English can be conversational.</li>
            <li>At least 3 hours of overlap with GMT+3 on working days.</li>
            <li>Strong Figma and UX/UI fundamentals: complete flows, edge cases and states, work inside a design system.</li>
            <li>AI in your design workflow today, with one example you can walk us through.</li>
            <li>Open to project-based freelance work.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="h5">Nice to have</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Coded prototypes, or experience with Claude Code, Cursor or Figma Make.</li>
            <li>Building or scaling a design system.</li>
            <li>Experience in one of the domains below.</li>
            <li>Turkish.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="h5">Specialisations</h3>
          <p>We are hiring first for <strong>UX research, mobile apps, web apps, and websites and CRO</strong>. Also of interest: product UX/UI and design systems; AI product and agent UX, AI media and creative tools; fintech, legaltech, CRM and RevOps.</p>

          <h3 class="h5">Engagement</h3>
          <p>Remote, project-based freelance work. Good collaborations can become ongoing. A full-time role may come later if it works well for both sides. We can't promise it.</p>

          <h3 class="h5">How we select</h3>
          <ol class="role__steps">
            <li>Application form</li>
            <li>Portfolio review</li>
            <li>A call with our team: how you work</li>
            <li>A second call with Başak: AI and your method</li>
            <li>Verification: a screen-share of a file you worked on, and possibly one reference</li>
            <li>Paid trial on a real task</li>
            <li>Start on client projects</li>
          </ol>
          <p>The trial is paid. We welcome applications from everyone, whatever your background. We judge the work and how you work.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="notice-box" data-reveal>
        <strong>Before you start</strong>
        <p class="text-sm">How we handle your data: <a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">Candidate Privacy Notice</a> (English) · <a class="text-link" href="/kvkk-aday/" lang="tr">Aday Aydınlatma Metni</a> (Türkçe). We never ask for ID numbers, bank details or sensitive personal data at this stage.</p>
      </div>

      {{apply_form}}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{{> footer}}
